    <item>
      <title>Aaron：康奈尔大学研究生Robert Tappan Morris坐在MIT的终端前,运行了一个程序。他23岁,父亲是NSA的首席科学家。 加州伯克利,劳伦斯利弗莫尔国家实验室的…</title>
      <link>https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6314a2cc0000000012003173/69d72df60000000023012bd1?xsec_token=ABN2jrbNa4oKyIgLK4HzsOFzohNZUv7oJgJKfMa3tOhw4=&amp;xsec_source=pc_user</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">xhs:69d72df60000000023012bd1</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 23:42:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>xhs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>康奈尔大学研究生Robert Tappan Morris坐在MIT的终端前,运行了一个程序。他23岁,父亲是NSA的首席科学家。 加州伯克利,劳伦斯利弗莫尔国家实验室的计算机科学家Russell Brand在家里用VAX计算机编辑一篇论文,写的恰好是计算机安全。晚上十点左右,屏幕卡住了。 他查看系统负载,正常情况下是1到2,现在是1000。 进程列表里,几十个陌生的进程在运行。文件系统里,几个从未见过的文件出现了。Brand也是加州大学伯克利分校的博士生。他拨通电话,联系了伯克利实验计算设施的一群同学。那群学生几小时前已经发现了同样的问题,并向全国网络发出了一条消息: &gt; &quot;We are currently under attack.&quot;(我们正在遭受攻击。) #创业 #人工智能 #计算机</p><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/86ae6b35f1570719e8107dc8564cb2c7/spectrum/1040g34o31unqiled340g5ookkb64gcbjquu1qo0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/01c6c37d1ffe91a26831725363ebd7c3/spectrum/1040g34o31unqigquhm705ookkb64gcbjjegjbq8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/7a3a661b33b5e1f05ba3bd417b560c81/spectrum/1040g34o31unqigquhm7g5ookkb64gcbjuvmh76g!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/58b477b98939039e4e38c1f2742513c0/spectrum/1040g34o31unqigquhm805ookkb64gcbjob2pato!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/d389bd84fd91e9827364ba20b0924972/spectrum/1040g34o31unqigquhm8g5ookkb64gcbjajr8u2g!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/21bbd76607f5d73e1f375faf1632b29d/spectrum/1040g34o31unqigquhm905ookkb64gcbjbdvaf88!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/39b3c2c3585361158d3c24656cda7aeb/spectrum/1040g34o31unqigquhm9g5ookkb64gcbjjg2o5bg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/c2e5a58f622ad54043cb6a41a9299223/spectrum/1040g34o31unqigquhma05ookkb64gcbjkc39vr8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609292136/bd63f92f095c29bfc1e05e30e6387c96/spectrum/1040g34o31unqigquhmag5ookkb64gcbjevfv0eg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="h