      <title>Aaron：爱泼斯坦 蒂尔马斯克，三十年的故事</title>
      <link>https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6314a2cc0000000012003173/69a514c0000000002303b778?xsec_token=AB43yuPZMR4BJQYgaLiMd8yiBb40ScpEJY0tXLuSkqQEU=&amp;xsec_source=pc_user</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">xhs:69a514c0000000002303b778</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Mar 2026 23:22:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>xhs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<strong>爱泼斯坦 蒂尔马斯克，三十年的故事</strong><p>2025年2月，特朗普签署了一项行政令，允许南非白人以&quot;受迫害&quot;身份申请美国难民。Musk 和 Thiel 都在南非种族隔离时代长大。Musk 的父亲靠祖母绿和钻石生意致富，Thiel 的父亲在南非做铀矿开采，Sacks 出生在开普敦。Democracy Now! 用了一个词，寡头。 Fanny &amp; Alexander 酒吧早就关门了。412 Emerson Street，帕罗奥图，现在是另一家餐厅。 那个晚上围着木头长桌喝啤酒的人，一个在等法庭传讯，两个的名字出现在300万份 Epstein 档案里，一个在德州的新办公室里预测加密货币的未来，一个在财报电话会上说消费者很聪明。 他们在 X 上互贴对方的 Epstein 邮件截图，但下一轮融资的时候，电话还是会打给彼此 #创业 PayPal #ElonMusk PeterThiel #MaxLevchin #硅谷 #DOGE #特朗普</p><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/2822299314d5b9a683976a38e9021982/spectrum/1040g0k031t6sulq1la0g5ookkb64gcbj951bgh0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/bae3b3d3027a93a250e320fa8cb33d3e/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflme705ookkb64gcbjoh7s1mo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/c954825272a51d43b4b85071bc4513b8/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflme7g5ookkb64gcbjopp64ag!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/95f2c8aebac0c2a4b8a6f27741325ddb/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflme805ookkb64gcbjrrcq2vo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/4f46031321e1ddde9319fa2184ecba28/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflme8g5ookkb64gcbjkdl7so0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/f81477c501df3ad71378276b9f9c55a3/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflme905ookkb64gcbj1ftfec0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/490498175653abc6420871a4a24fc13c/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflme9g5ookkb64gcbjs1bj24g!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/f35d01a79b9eb91b60874df6274f8d38/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflmea05ookkb64gcbj4v8svpg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/90e248c711b67443c29356b03cef7499/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflmeag5ookkb64gcbjck3dps8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/b595f3b03b400f448a421156288d2fa7/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflmeb05ookkb64gcbjs8tlq6o!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/eaae3684a505885094dc044f975697e7/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflmebg5ookkb64gcbjrp0nvhg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610010032/072bf7ad41ee285b1f549e7b9a79dc56/spectrum/1040g34o31t6suiflmec05ookkb64gcbj2r7idn0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6314a2cc0000000012003173/69a514c0000000002303b778?xsec_token=AB43yuPZMR4BJQYgaLiMd8yiBb40ScpEJY0tXLuSkqQEU=&amp;xsec_source=pc_user">原文</a></p>]]></description>
